# =============================================================================
# .gitignore -- IgG BCR expression-ready selection
# =============================================================================

# Donor input: IgBLAST TSVs are large and contain donor sequence data, so they
# never leave the machine that produced them. No example dataset is shipped
# either -- see README, "What this repository deliberately does not contain",
# for what a fresh clone does on first run.
data/

# Pipeline outputs
output/

# Downloaded / cached germline references. These are IMGT data: keep them on
# disk for the run, do not redistribute them from this repository.
reference/

# Optional manual request list
selected_cells.xlsx

# Local overrides of the tunable parameters
config.ini

# R
.Rhistory
.RData
.Rproj.user/
*.Rproj

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.swp
